From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leonardo Bornia <leonardo.bornia@toradex.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:50:18 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: monaco-monza-som: supply both SerDes rails

The Ethernet SerDes has a 0.9 V (vreg_l4a) and a 1.2 V (vreg_l5a)
supply. The SoM only gives it vreg_l5a through phy-supply, so nothing
in Linux keeps vreg_l4a on for the SerDes: the first SerDes
initialization works on the rail the boot firmware left on, and every
later one (ip link down/up, the TX watchdog reset after a link change)
times out on QSERDES_COM_C_READY_STATUS until a reboot.

Name both rails with the vdda-0p9/vdda-1p2 supplies the SerDes PHY
driver votes for, as qcs8300-ride does in mainline, and document
vdda-1p2-supply in the binding (from mainline 3719850f1b70).

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Leonardo Bornia <leonardo.bornia@toradex.com>
---
 .../bindings/phy/qcom,sa8775p-dwmac-sgmii-phy.yaml       | 9 ++++++++-
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/monaco-monza-som.dtsi           | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sa8775p-dwmac-sgmii-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sa8775p-dwmac-sgmii-phy.yaml
index 0a1330b91..e573abcb9 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sa8775p-dwmac-sgmii-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sa8775p-dwmac-sgmii-phy.yaml
@@ -35,10 +35,17 @@ properties:
   phy-supply:
     description:
       Phandle to a regulator that provides power to the PHY.
+    deprecated: true
 
   vdda-0p9-supply:
     description:
-      Phandle to a 0.9V regulator supply to the PHY.
+      Phandle to a 0.9V regulator supply to the PHY, which draws a peak
+      current of 46 mA.
+
+  vdda-1p2-supply:
+    description:
+      Phandle to a 1.2V regulator supply to the PHY, which draws a peak
+      current of 15 mA.
 
   "#phy-cells":
     const: 0
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/monaco-monza-som.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/monaco-monza-som.dtsi
index 9b5ed5593..143c6e87d 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/monaco-monza-som.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/monaco-monza-som.dtsi
@@ -284,7 +284,8 @@ &sdhc_1 {
 
 /* Ethernet/SGMII */
 &serdes0 {
-	phy-supply = <&vreg_l5a>;
+	vdda-0p9-supply = <&vreg_l4a>;
+	vdda-1p2-supply = <&vreg_l5a>;
 
 	status = "okay";
 };
